# Build Workflow

<!-- @project-config:gulp-tasks -->
## Commands

```bash
npm start                  # Watch mode (dev build + BrowserSync) — same as `npm run dev`
npm run dev                # Watch mode (alias for `npm start`)
npm run build              # Production build (NODE_ENV=production gulp prod)
npm run build:dev          # Dev build, no watch / no server
npm run sass               # Compile SCSS only
npm run js                 # Compile JS only
npm run rtlcss             # Generate style-rtl.css from style.css
npm run lint:css           # stylelint on src/sass/**/*.scss
npm run lint:js            # eslint on src/js/custom/**/*.js
npm run cleanup:scss       # Remove unused SCSS via tools/cleanup script
npm run clean              # Delete dist/
npm run test               # Run unit tests (alias for test:unit)
npm run test:unit          # vitest run
npm run test:unit:watch    # vitest watch
npm run test:unit:coverage # vitest run --coverage
npm run test:e2e           # playwright test
npm run test:e2e:ui        # playwright test --ui
npm run test:e2e:headed    # playwright test --headed
npm run test:php           # composer test
```

## Gulp Tasks (gulpfile.mjs)

| Task | Input | Output | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| `sassTask` | `src/sass/style.scss` | `style.css` | Main stylesheet (postcss in prod: autoprefixer + sort-media-queries + cssnano) |
| `blockSassTask` | `blocks/**/*.scss` | `blocks/**/*.css` (in-place) | Per-block styles |
| `swiperJsTask` | `src/js/swiper-init.js` | `assets/js/swiper-bundle.js` | esbuild IIFE bundle |
| `pluginsJsTask` | `src/js/plugins/*.js` | `assets/js/plugins.js` | Simple concat |
| `customJsTask` | `src/js/custom/**/*.js` | `assets/js/custom.js` | Concat, DOMContentLoaded wrapped |
| `rtlCssTask` | `style.css` | `style-rtl.css` | RTL stylesheet |
| `purgeCSSTask` | `style.css` | purged `style.css` | Production only (commented out by default) |
| `purgeCSSAuditTask` | `style.css` + `blocks/**/*.css` | `purge-audit.txt` | Dry-run audit, nothing written to source |
| `criticalTask` | live URL | `critical.css` | Critical CSS extraction (commented out by default) |
| `lintJS` | `src/js/custom/**/*.js` | (stdout) | ESLint via CLI, non-blocking |
| `lintCSS` | `src/sass/**/*.scss` | (stdout) | stylelint via CLI, non-blocking |
| `clean` | — | deletes `dist/` | |
| `cleanMaps` | `**/*.css.map`, `**/*.js.map` | deletes maps | Runs at start of prod build |
<!-- @end -->

## PostCSS Pipeline

- **Dev**: autoprefixer + sort-media-queries
- **Prod**: autoprefixer + sort-media-queries + cssnano (minify)

## Manual Block SCSS Compilation

When not using Gulp watch:

```bash
npx sass blocks/{slug}/{slug}.scss blocks/{slug}/{slug}.css --no-source-map
```

## Asset Enqueueing (functions/enqueue-scripts.php)

- Block CSS/JS only loaded when block exists on page (`has_block()`)
- CSS versioned by `filemtime()` for cache busting
- Block JS gets `defer` attribute automatically
- Block JS depends on `skel-swiper` script handle

## JS File Pipeline

| Source | Output | Method |
|---|---|---|
| `src/js/plugins/*.js` | `assets/js/plugins.js` | Gulp concat |
| `src/js/custom/*.js` | `assets/js/custom.js` | Gulp concat (DOMContentLoaded wrapped) |
| `src/js/swiper-init.js` | `assets/js/swiper-bundle.js` | esbuild bundle |
| `blocks/{slug}/{slug}.js` | (loaded directly) | Enqueued conditionally per-page |
